Data availability

            The EHR data used in this study were obtained through a data access agreement with Truveta and cannot be publicly deposited owing to patient privacy and de-identification requirements under Truveta’s data governance framework. State-day aggregated counts underlying the main results are available from the corresponding authors upon reasonable request, subject to Truveta’s data sharing policies. Requests should be directed to A.N.-S. (anori-sarma@hsph.harvard.edu) or M.D.W. (mwillis1@bu.edu) and will receive a response within 30 days.
          Code availability

            All analytic code used in this study, including code for data extraction, DLNMs, meta-analysis, attributable burden estimation and figure generation, is publicly available via GitHub at https://github.com/asarma868/TruvetaHeatEDvisits2025.
